From ddfe90416ddceae0aa66f6f1f8aef0d895ff8a22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leerep <leerep@163.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 15:03:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libnftnl: add the autoreconf fixup

The fullcone patch touches src/Makefile.am, which is newer than the
src/Makefile.in pre-generated in the tarball, so automake's maintainer
rebuild rule kicks in.  That rule wants the automake release the tarball was
built with (libnftnl 1.3.1: automake-1.17) while the host tools ship 1.18.1,
and OpenWrt only symlinks aclocal across versions, so the build dies with
"automake-1.17: command not found".  Regenerate the build system with the
host autotools instead, which also decouples us from the tarball's automake
version.

Same fix as openwrt-sonic-fullcone 1ea9d51.

Signed-off-by: leerep <leerep@163.com>

---
 package/libs/libnftnl/Makefile | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/package/libs/libnftnl/Makefile b/package/libs/libnftnl/Makefile
index dd0de5c8d6..d848826252 100644
--- a/package/libs/libnftnl/Makefile
+++ b/package/libs/libnftnl/Makefile
@@ -24,6 +24,8 @@ PKG_INSTALL:=1
 PKG_BUILD_PARALLEL:=1
 PKG_BUILD_FLAGS:=lto
 
+PKG_FIXUP:=autoreconf
+
 include $(INCLUDE_DIR)/package.mk
 
 DISABLE_NLS:=
